The leading `s_nexttime` makes the target check begin one sampled clock later. The lemmas below use that same timing, while accounting for reset between samples. ([rfsoc.mit.edu](https://rfsoc.mit.edu/6S965/_static/F24/documentation/1800-2017.pdf?utm_source=openai))

