      "explanation": "At the peak with m clear, the next update lowers vol and sig, or resets them. This resolves the remaining high cycle."
    },
    {
      "lemma": "property lemma_4; @(posedge clk) (!m && (vol == 0 || vol == N-1)) |=> !sig; endproperty",
      "explanation": "After either a reset or departure from the peak, sig remains low on the following clock. Together, these one-step facts cover the target's two-cycle obligation."
